title: The Antifaschistische Aktion
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: antifaschistische_aktion_formed == 1 and antifaschistische_aktion_timer = 0
on-arrival: antifaschistische_aktion_timer = 7; month_actions += 1; rfb_militarization_cost = 2 if rfb_militancy > 0.1 else rfb_militarization_cost = 1; rfb_militarization_cost = 3 if rfb_militancy > 0.25
card-image: img/iron_front.png
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs, antifascism

= The Antifaschistische Aktion

The Antifaschistische Aktion is our new antifascist coordination front, consisting of the KPD, the RFB, and other leftist groups. How should we use the Antifaschistische Aktion?

[? if workers_kpd < 20: Unfortunately, the Antifaschistische Aktion's effectiveness is dragged down by the KPD's unpopularity. Many RFB members have left, and many workers are not interested. ?]

- @defense: Rally for defense against the fascists with the RFB.
- @pacifism: Rally for pacifism, against nationalism and war.
- @communism: Rally for the coming revolution against the bourgeoise.
- @easy_discard

@defense
subtitle: -[+ rfb_militarization_cost +] resources
choose-if: resources >= rfb_militarization_cost
on-arrival: resources -= rfb_militarization_cost; rfb_strength += 50; rfb_militancy += 0.05; z_relation -= 5 if historical_mode

The Antifaschistische Aktion rallies for the militant defense of the Communist Party against the fascist and democartic paramilitaries, strengthening the RFB.



@pacifism
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 5 if pacifism >= 3; workers_kpd += 5*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4; unemployed_kpd += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4; new_middle_kpd += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4

The Antifaschistische Aktion rallies against imperialist warmongering.

@communism
on-arrival: pro_republic -= 5*(1-dissent); democratization -= 1; workers_kpd += 5*(1-dissent) if democratization <= 0; unemployed_kpd += 4*(1-dissent)

The Antifaschistische Aktion rallies against bourgeoise "democracy" and for true communism.

# TODO
The Nazis and other far-right political movements are increasingly turning their hatred against the Jewish community of Germany. The Iron Front rallies in defense of individual Jews and the broader community against violence.
